<title>NETHERLANDS: PIRELLI HAS 98.7 PCT OF PIR TYRE .</title>
<headline>PIRELLI HAS 98.7 PCT OF PIR TYRE .</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amsterdam-listed Pirelli Tyre Holding NV said on Thursday Italy's Pirelli SpA now holds 98.7 percent of Pirelli Tyre's ordinary shares.</p>
<p>Pirelli SpA -- which already had a majority stake in Pirelli Tyre -- launched a bid of 19.50 guilders per share for the remaining outstanding shares in January.</p>
